   Deng, Xuejie; Yang, Yinchao, Kailuan Grp Ltd Liabil Corp, Tangshan 063018, Peoples R China.
   Xu, Xichen, Tsinghua Univ, Dept Civil Engn, Beijing 100084, Peoples R China.
